@startuml
!include r4-sequence-style.puml
title FE-11 Owner Edits Published Review
actor "Member" as Actor
participant "<<view>>\n:ReviewPages" as Pages
participant "<<controller>>\n:ReviewController" as Controller
participant "<<service>>\n:ReviewService" as Service
participant "<<repository>>\n:ReviewRepository" as Repo
participant "<<repository>>\n:ReviewRevisionRepository" as RevisionRepo
participant "<<database>>\n:MySQL Database" as DB

Actor -> Pages : Edit own review
activate Pages
Pages -> Controller : PATCH review + If-Match-Version
activate Controller
Controller -> Service : verify ownership and version
activate Service
Service -> Repo : update rating/text keeping PUBLIC
activate Repo
Repo -> DB : UPDATE review
DB --> Repo : new review version
Repo --> Service : new review version
deactivate Repo
Service -> RevisionRepo : append revision and audit
activate RevisionRepo
RevisionRepo -> DB : INSERT review revision
DB --> RevisionRepo : revision recorded
RevisionRepo --> Service : revision recorded
deactivate RevisionRepo
Service --> Controller : updated safe owner projection
deactivate Service
Controller --> Pages : HTTP 200 or HTTP 409
deactivate Controller
Pages --> Actor : Display updated review or conflict
deactivate Pages
note over Actor,Pages
Another Member receives safe 403/404.
REMOVED review is not hard-deleted.
end note
@enduml
